  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>History, being the record of the fate that alters the present as it occurs, is doomed to repeat itself in much the same way that a crochet needle follows the same path again and again to produce a scarf.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Student of the Loom</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Once per day, you can play a least or lesser portent from your discard pile as though it were in your hand. On-play effects, such as all least portents in the discard pile shuffling into your active deck when a lesser portent is played, are not triggered.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/cartomancy-feats#toc32\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
